&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is California-based only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discord is the place for all things gaming.&amp;nbsp; Discord is the place where players have their entire hangout experience with friends – from before, during, and after gaming sessions.&amp;nbsp; Discord is also the place where every major game publisher and studio maintains an official community.&amp;nbsp; And finally Discord is the place where the latest news, beta codes, and big gaming moments happen.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for Account Executives to join as founding members of the sales team for our new Quests ads business line. In this role you work on the mobile gaming business at Discord and be influential in developing our ad product offering for this segment. We are seeking an individual who is passionate about games, the game industry, and helping game companies market to the players who are most passionate about their games.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working in a zero to 1 environment to build up and grow a new, and fast-growing business line at Discord.&amp;nbsp; You will harness your prior experience in advertising/media/marketing spaces and bring a combination of strategic business thinking, industry relationships, product insights, and an ability to build a significant, recurring book of business with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate Revenue: &lt;/strong&gt;You will drive new partnerships with game publishers, studios, and their media agencies to build new and repeatable revenue streams for Discord’s emerging mobile ads business. You will prospect and source new opportunities, navigate client needs against Discord’s offerings, and negotiate and close business deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Strategic Insights: &lt;/strong&gt;You will work collaboratively and cross functionally with internal teams to bring strategic recommendations for the product road map. You will work with teammates within the sales function to build and enhance scalable processes for the growing ads business.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Client Partnerships: &lt;/strong&gt;You will work with clients to identify their marketing needs, and develop strategic proposals that deliver value against those needs. You will build and deepen longterm, strategic relationships with senior decision makers across the gaming segment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Thought Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;You will demonstrate expertise around the gaming, media, marketing, and advertising spaces to clients, within Discord, and in industry forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of direct experience in ad sales in the gaming industry, specifically in building new business from scratch with major players in the gaming sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in delivering against account and revenue goals, specifically with building new mobile business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships with top marketing decision-makers at game publishers and their agencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data and identify insights to assess campaign performance, and proactively troubleshoot and problem-solve quickly and through the proper escalation channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working internally with cross-functional partners to influence product development and processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for regional in-person client meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The total annual target compensation range for this full-time position is $272,000 - $306,000 OTE + equity + benefits. Our compensation ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed reflect the OTE (base salary + target variable compensation) only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role must be based on the West Coast (U.S.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This hire will be critical in supporting the company to deeply understand and mitigate how harmful content, including child sexual abuse material, manifests on our platform, as well as investigating complex threats, advancing our investigative capabilities, and developing innovative approaches to prevent harm to our users, particularly minors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role involves exposure to graphic and/or objectionable content including but not limited to graphic images, videos and writings, offensive and derogatory language, and other potentially objectionable material, e.g. child exploitation, graphic violence, self-injury, animal abuse, and other content which may be considered offensive or disturbing.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and respond to sensitive content reports in our queues, including but not limited to the review of child exploitation, graphic violence, self-injury and suicide,&amp;nbsp; explicit images, videos and other objectionable and/or disturbing content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate complex cases to develop a detailed understanding of how abuse is occurring and attribute it to the person(s), and/or networks responsible, in order to prepare high quality written reports, for both internal and external audiences, including law enforcement agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate operational excellence when evaluating risks, threats, and user privacy in time-critical situations and execute decision-making while analyzing a variety of factors that include imminence of danger, sensitivities, and/or graphic content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively in responding to sensitive issues, providing deep knowledge into different exploitative content types and sharing insights and expertise about minor safety and exploitative content issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify currently undetected abuse by leveraging internal data, open-source intelligence, trusted partner information and third party private intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to users experiencing safety-related or high harm issues and empathetically address their concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 - 2 years of experience in Trust and Safety moderation, with some exposure to child safety review and removal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with a second language (preferably Spanish, Portuguese, or Arabic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work 1-2 hours on Saturdays, and flexibility to pick up non-standard shifts such as early morning or evening, and weekend/ holiday shifts to support our global operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate in a high tempo, sensitive environment while meeting specific SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills with an ability to communicate complex information, concepts, or ideas in a confident and well-organized manner through verbal, written, and/or visual means.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tertiary qualifications or equivalent experience in Intelligence Studies, Cybersecurity, Criminal Justice, Criminology or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in utilizing SQL, Python or other programming language for data manipulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $100,000 to $112,500 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Senior IT Project Manager with a strong background in business systems and Oracle Fusion to oversee and drive the successful delivery of complex IT projects. In this role, you will manage the implementation, optimization, and integration of business systems, with a focus on Oracle Fusion applications, while ensuring compliance with regulatory standards and maintaining operational efficiency. This position requires a deep understanding of business system implementations, project management in public companies, and experience working with Oracle Fusion in a highly regulated, dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Planning &amp;amp; Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead and manage the end-to-end delivery of large-scale business systems projects, particularly Oracle Fusion. Ensure projects are completed on time, within budget, and aligned with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain strong communication with senior leadership, business units, and IT teams to ensure project objectives are aligned with organizational priorities. Provide regular status updates, risk assessments, and progress reports to executive teams and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oracle Fusion Implementation &amp;amp; Integration: &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee the implementation and optimization of Oracle Fusion applications (e.g., Finance, HR, Procurement, Supply Chain, and CRM) while ensuring seamless integration with existing enterprise systems and data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with business leaders across departments (Finance, HR, Operations, IT) to understand business needs and deliver solutions that improve operational efficiency and support company growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Compliance Oversight: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure that all project deliverables meet the regulatory requirements and compliance standards of a public company, including Sarbanes-Oxley (SOX), data privacy, and financial reporting regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Issue Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively identify risks, issues, and changes in project scope. Develop mitigation strategies and ensure that projects remain on track despite challenges, with a strong focus on maintaining compliance and meeting deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Partner Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate with Oracle and third-party vendors to ensure timely delivery of services, resolve technical challenges, and meet contractual obligations. Manage vendor relationships and service level agreements (SLAs) for optimal project outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Financial Oversight: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage project budgets, including forecasting and tracking expenditures. Ensure the financial health of the project while adhering to cost constraints. Report on financial metrics and project costs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Continuously evaluate project management processes to drive operational efficiencies, improve quality, and streamline the delivery of business system solutions. Implement best practices and lessons learned across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Documentation: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure rigorous governance and project documentation standards are followed, including project plans, status reports, risk registers, and post-implementation reviews. Maintain transparency and provide audit-ready documentation in alignment with corporate policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, Business, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in IT project management, with proven experience managing ERP projects (e.g., SAP, Oracle, Microsoft Dynamics, etc.), with specific experience in Procure-to-Pay (P2P) and Quote-to-Cash (Q2C) processes, preferably in a public company environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth experience managing business systems projects in regulated industries, with a strong understanding of Sarbanes-Oxley (SOX), financial reporting, and other compliance frameworks relevant to public companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading complex Oracle Fusion implementations, integrations, and optimizations, including financial, HR, and supply chain modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of project management methodologies (Agile, Waterfall, Scrum) and familiarity with project management tools (e.g., Jira, Confluence, Microsoft Project, Asana).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, interpersonal, and leadership skills, with the ability to effectively work across all levels of the organization, including executive leadership, cross-functional teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills, with the ability to manage complex, high-stakes projects with multiple dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with IT governance, risk management, and compliance requirements for public companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management Professional (PMP), Agile Certified Practitioner (ACP), or similar certification preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $192,000 to $216,000 + equity + benefits. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is a voice, video, and text communication app over two hundred million people use it to hang out and play games with their friends. We’re building an outstanding marketing and communications organization to help shape and broaden our brand and appeal to more players.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Creative Director with a design background and deep experience engaging developer audiences to join our Brand Creative team. This role is ideal for a visionary leader who understands how to translate complex technical concepts into visually compelling narratives that resonate with game developers and B2B audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Creative Director, you’ll lead the creative vision for Discord’s developer marketing initiatives, shaping campaigns, branding, and storytelling that inspire, educate, and engage game developers worldwide. You’ll collaborate closely with cross-functional teams—including marketing, product, social, and partnerships—to drive innovation and ensure creative excellence across all developer-facing touchpoints. This role will report directly to the Head of the Creative Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to craft meaningful experiences that reinforce Discord’s position as an essential platform for developers, from indie studios to AAA publishers, and influence how they connect with their communities. This role is ideal for a visionary creative leader who comprehends game developers and B2B audiences, possesses a robust design background, and is enthusiastic about creating impactful campaigns that bring Discord’s brand to life. 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Creative Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; – Develop and execute a compelling creative vision for Discord’s developer marketing efforts, ensuring alignment with broader brand objectives while engaging game developers in fresh, innovative ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conceptualize &amp;amp; Execute Campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; – Drive the ideation, design, and execution of high-impact brand and marketing campaigns that resonate with developers and elevate Discord’s presence in the gaming industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen Brand Identity&lt;/strong&gt; – Shape and evolve Discord’s brand positioning for game developers, ensuring a consistent and compelling presence across web, video, social, events, and other key touchpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; – Work cross-functionally with marketing, product, social, design, and partnerships teams to ensure creative alignment and seamless execution of developer-focused initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Build, mentor, and inspire a team of multidisciplinary designers and creatives, fostering a culture of innovation, collaboration, and design excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with External Partners&lt;/strong&gt; – Collaborate with creative agencies, game developers, production teams, and influencers to craft visually stunning, high-impact creative that enhances Discord’s reputation within the gaming ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Creativity&lt;/strong&gt; – Leverage insights and performance metrics to refine and optimize creative strategies, ensuring maximum impact and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; – Oversee multiple projects simultaneously, ensuring smooth execution, clear prioritization, and alignment with top company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Thrive In This Role If you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in design-led creative roles, including 5+ years in leadership, driving brand and campaign strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in engaging developer audiences, particularly within the gaming or tech industries, with a strong understanding of their needs, interests, and challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead and execute large-scale, multi-channel brand campaigns from concept to completion, delivering measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of brand identity, storytelling, and visual design principles, with a keen eye for innovation and audience engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning, managing, or executing events, particularly within the gaming or developer community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams and managing relationships with external partners, including advertising agencies, production companies, and influencers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for gaming and game development, with a deep appreciation for the creative and technical processes within the developer community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and leadership skills, combining strategic thinking with a hands-on approach to problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in creative tools (e.g., Adobe Creative Suite, Figma) and experience overseeing the production process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment, adapt to shifting priorities and manage multiple projects efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to transform complex ideas into clear, engaging, and impactful creative strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or within a game development studio or esports organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep passion for gaming and a strong understanding of Discord’s role in the gaming ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of emerging trends in gaming, digital media, and content creation, with an eye for innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $208,000 to $234,000 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a group of Customer Experience professionals here at Discord, and we are looking for someone who shares our dedication to supporting others with extra care and problem-solving expertise! This teammate must possess exemplary empathy and unwavering patience as they directly support our amazing community. This includes timely assistance to users experiencing account-related issues, including login problems, password resets, and account recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a team member, you’ll be on the frontlines of supporting our communities, listening to their feedback, and sharing these insights with other stakeholders to help make the Discord experience the best it can be! If you’re looking for an amazing support team, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working the Morning Shift on Tuesday to Saturday (9 AM to 6 PM CEST)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work remotely but expect you to occasionally be present in our Amsterdam office to connect with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must be local.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering timely, accurate, and thoughtful responses to our users’ questions and requests through our support channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating user account requests, providing timely, accurate, and educational responses to our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring Discord user security trends, identify opportunities for improved operational efficiency, and provide actionable feedback to partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring the security and integrity of user accounts by implementing and enforcing security protocols and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and resolving suspicious or unauthorized account activities, including identifying potential security breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams to address user account issues and implement solutions that enhance user experience and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educating users on account security measures and promote awareness of potential risks and vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining accurate records of user interactions and resolutions, and contribute to developing support documentation and knowledge base resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in troubleshooting account-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal, with the ability to explain technical concepts clearly to non-technical users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only English is necessary, but any of the following languages are a plus: Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, French, German, and Turkish with both written and speaking fluency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced environment and prioritize tasks effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills with knowledge of desktop and mobile operating systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer service solutions platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building communities and belief in our mission at Discord.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to diversity and inclusion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer support or technical support roles is required, as well as a passion for supporting our users with unwavering patience and empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
