&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience &lt;strong&gt;building data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; in production environments with high volumes of consumer data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;designing, developing, and maintaining robust data models &lt;/strong&gt;from structured and unstructured sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience writing &lt;strong&gt;accurate and effective code in SQL and Python&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
