&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development &lt;/strong&gt;– Lead and mentor a team of procurement professionals, fostering a high-performance culture and driving career development within the function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Relationship Management &lt;/strong&gt;– Partner cross-functionally with finance, legal, and operational teams to integrate procurement strategies into company-wide initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Workflow Design&lt;/strong&gt; – Lead the design and execution of procurement workflows that streamline operations while maintaining strong governance. Drive continuous improvements across procurement and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procurement Tooling &amp;amp; Automation &lt;/strong&gt;– Evaluate, implement, and optimize procurement technology solutions to enhance efficiency, compliance, and spend visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of procurement experience, with a strong emphasis on Software, Professional Services, and stakeholder management. Experience with Cloud Infrastructure negotiations would be a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years people management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in high-growth, tech, or fast-scaling environments, with the ability to navigate ambiguity and evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management to understand stakeholder priorities and the ability to drive procurement strategy in alignment with broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in designing and scaling procurement workflows and processes across multiple business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep negotiation experience&lt;/strong&gt; managing complex, high-value contracts from start to finish by driving planning and leading negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial and analytical acumen, with the ability to assess total cost of ownership (TCO) and supplier risk.&lt;/li&gt;
